---
title: Translating Vague Questions
---
flowchart TD
    V["Vague Question\nIs X related to Y?"] --> Q1{"What is\nthe outcome?"}
    Q1 --> Q2{"Continuous or\ncategorical?"}
    Q2 -->|"Continuous"| R1["Regression\nor correlation"]
    Q2 -->|"Categorical"| R2["Chi-square\nor logistic"]
    Q1 --> Q3{"How many\ngroups?"}
    Q3 -->|"Two"| R3["t-test or\nWilcoxon"]
    Q3 -->|"Three+"| R4["ANOVA or\nKruskal-Wallis"]
